{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_title", "source_sha256": "4e40fa618b1948c57c65f2016d2d39382e1c1d2762be354f207970ee3cd02df1", "ja": "その手をひらけば", "zh": "若是张开那双手", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_synopsis", "source_sha256": "59b51691f18e11f4ff0c01b041de47181d2b9dbf2a7174c48997ce68d7b953d0", "ja": "定期公演の新曲を任された志保。だが、弟が\n体調を崩した際、母が預けた給料を生活費に\n使っていない事を知る。自分は役に立たない\nのかと悩む志保だったが、プロデューサーの\n言葉で、母とも新曲とも素直に向き合う。", "zh": "志保受托负责定期公演的新歌。然而在弟弟身体不舒服时，她得知母亲并没有将自己寄存在那里的工资用作生活费。志保开始苦恼自己是不是派不上用场，但制作人的一番话，让她得以坦率面对母亲和新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1000_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1001_p", "source_sha256": "921e5af8570f23b2941c797ce765b1db48e96db620b1938bfe5eb53a3465ddf4", "ja": "（今日は、午後から次の定期公演のミーティングだ。\nメンバーは決まったし、あとはレッスンを……ん？）", "zh": "（今天下午要开下一场定期公演的会议。成员已经定下来了，接下来只要练习……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6afb9ac07b851785c568b19a3a4e188c44742ef07b51e48c9d49306d629f0dcc", "ja": "お疲れさま、志保！　ずいぶん早いんだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，志保！你来得真早啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "c1e97e46b72de9d5fc25b9792411e1007465452292b52ec3b0dec88f12c8dc8f", "ja": "あ……{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生。\n你辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2f48da6ee81dd92aa7e0b5c4b2e9c0a15d92b75a25e0c87d288a223d367e648f", "ja": "新曲の事だけど、希望は決まったか？\nステージの演出の事とかでも……。", "zh": "关于新曲，希望已经确定了吗？\n或者舞台演出方面的想法也可以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "07ca69d4c353eb9b0c765d0e5795cae2b664402ec6bc2be791051d8c4d780ea2", "ja": "あ……すみません。昨日は、バタバタしていて……\nその、考えるのを忘れていました……。", "zh": "啊……对不起。昨天有点手忙脚乱的……\n那个，我忘了考虑这件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5ca09b3ea216797324b1f0d9c3663dfd721f72fb93a650339059e21b854b330d", "ja": "え、そうなのか？　志保が仕事の事を忘れるなんて、\n珍しいな。家で何かあったのか？", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？志保居然会忘记工作的事，还真少见。家里发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "e42915811859455dfc77464f7a8ef0cf7708c679bea69db11e9174e483295365", "ja": "……そんな、大したことじゃないんですけど。\n昨日は、弟が体調を悪くしてしまって……それで。", "zh": "……没、其实不是什么大不了的事。\n昨天我弟弟身体不太舒服……所以才会这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1008_p", "source_sha256": "203ca0ddc7790c209b6c6ac16bef9b4b4440a454f286b3537bf9fd0a4f43f729", "ja": "そうだったのか。小さい子はすぐに具合が\n悪くなったりするみたいだし、大変だよな。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。小孩子好像很容易身体不舒服，真是辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1010_p", "source_sha256": "394040c2aa9ff3ad5696a462b6aa269e5850beed97796f7c46ba4e817ea1e36c", "ja": "志保？\n……今、時間があるよな。少し話せるか？", "zh": "志保？\n……你现在有空吧。能稍微聊聊吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "5e5d6cd0f0f7043fedcda2ded03cfd422de344b64185071a76c8603a904637f9", "ja": "あ、はい……。", "zh": "啊，好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "1067fbc15cb265fc99b95b4c04540ca4435f67b3d6ad536370568b0a29d3a999", "ja": "……そういうわけで。私のお給料は、\n母が全部貯金していたみたいなんです。", "zh": "……就是这样。我的薪水，\n好像都被母亲存起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1014_p", "source_sha256": "56bbe5e7e44132a7f6675abcc33725df1799a1117b9098dbac79b28d76635ad5", "ja": "そうか。見つかっちゃったんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。被发现了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "5dc0bf712d256bc1145f348b6ceee5e72e49df797e95287eea454d9ac8730e11", "ja": "見つかっちゃったんだな、って……\n{$P$}さん、知ってたんですか？", "zh": "被发现了啊……\n{$P$}先生，您知道的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f998d5c5d34aa3883b7783d831f284c584f60874d7342b6f864bc9ca18ff9e3a", "ja": "ああ。前に志保のお母さんと話をした時に、\n貯金しているって聞かせてもらったよ。", "zh": "嗯。之前和志保的妈妈聊天时，她告诉过我，志保一直在存钱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "0d96561d3fe6125ebf3272ae25009ee02b287e24f633ba427a066234ad8be42a", "ja": "そんな……\nどうして、教えてくれなかったんですか。", "zh": "怎么会这样……\n为什么不告诉我呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "55c474d5db33e4e537c1625fed19f1b8f0bdbd737cb7516afb1dc87d019438d5", "ja": "それって、私の……私なんかのお給料くらいじゃ、\n全然、役に立たないってことじゃないですか。", "zh": "那不就意味着，靠我的……靠我这点工资，根本帮不上什么忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6c4f2a00d1685ebb74b11e4e8727133a727514c872dbd65a8b81d799859c5d37", "ja": "役に立たないなんて、そんな事はないよ。\n志保はちゃんと、お母さんの支えになってるんだから。", "zh": "才没有帮不上忙这回事呢。\n志保明明好好地支持着妈妈呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "21159b1761c9b5277ae7678261a59b4c926bd417f8ee009cca55bf868fdeacbd", "ja": "そういうの、いいです。\nそんな……なぐさめるみたいなのは。", "zh": "这种话就不用了。那种……像是在安慰我的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "a5df1676ddf4fcc34fef255312fe8e077f128b09ea1677fea5de362b95ebd7c8", "ja": "それに、母も言ってましたから。私が働いてお金を\n稼いでも、家にいられないことには変わりないって。", "zh": "而且，母亲也说过。就算我工作赚钱，也改变不了没法待在家里的事实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "1da0f573705e7331639f475037dba776b77b5c611283c62439c73d51095c8693", "ja": "だから……私が仕事をしても、意味がないんです。\nちっとも、役に立ってない……。", "zh": "所以……就算我工作了，也没有意义。\n一点忙都没帮上……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1023_p", "source_sha256": "5f443789b1efb4e026d49d07725026c97eef2b9f2e9ea7811325b4e5b685c0a5", "ja": "そんな事はないよ、志保。\nお母さんは……。", "zh": "没那回事，志保。\n你妈妈她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "0f4e12ff657629f2a5eab634fe197165990a968af7d4c8ab8248b577c9470f74", "ja": "私にかまわないで……放っておいてください。\n……失礼します。", "zh": "请别管我……请不要再管我了。\n……失礼了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1025_p", "source_sha256": "d722c8ae2268dc4f434238fc4ac98967f96bf747d87c1cc5c7973d793dfcc436", "ja": "あっ、志保？", "zh": "啊，志保？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1026_se", "source_sha256": "d0ae3df6a8bd7ebcc96db16d419f4e6f294f0b7818a4c7676477dc7f91cad56d", "ja": "ガチャ、バタン！", "zh": "扭蛋，砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "0b00f339f602e8ece9cc45deea11ad676f2fd69381dd572c094545df999e680e", "ja": "あっ、志保ちゃん！\nもう来てたんだね……？", "zh": "啊，志保！\n你已经到了呀……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "6c30f79e3cedb35ad307418a35110b228e9d4754b19de097b73fb4d7564defd3", "ja": "志保、どこに行くの？\nこれから公演のミーティングじゃ……。", "zh": "志保，你要去哪里？\n接下来不是要开演出的例会吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1029_p", "source_sha256": "fae3105eb50e955d49fb0866cabfee3562fc26084b5eb7f4a7871185d774ee73", "ja": "待ってくれ、志保！", "zh": "志保，等等！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "219d28931b63bbf1b50e7cebf471e5a45f1b0a27941bf24cccf931a3bfe42152", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n志保、どうかしたんです？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n志保她怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ff4069cc81110e36e986c219f3ca145d095291e47df2858298977c1a2efcd198", "ja": "志保ちゃん、なんだか顔色が\n悪いように見えましたけど……。", "zh": "志保，你看起来脸色好像不太好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1032_p", "source_sha256": "2eec21785363aefe0222f060c2dbf487fad3338489a60ce6ef44211317ed0437", "ja": "風花、奈緒、ちょうど良かった。\n今日のミーティング、任せていいか？", "zh": "风花、奈绪，来得正好。今天的会议可以交给你们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1033_p", "source_sha256": "dc1a043364e9e3d347199eb146c595187aa039087b694845ce8b9c4e9bc0fc47", "ja": "詳しいことは、机の上に置いてある\nスケジュール表を見てくれ。すまない、頼んだ！", "zh": "详细情况请看桌上放的日程表。不好意思，就拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1034_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1fad841b28a330487d55677350c8d8a18397f4967bd1136c560bc679a8f34e63", "ja": "あっ……は、はい！\nわかりました、奈緒ちゃんと進めておきますね。", "zh": "啊……好、好的！\n我明白了，我会和奈绪一起推进的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1035_037nao", "source_sha256": "c70429c01267dcb35860d0027f88633e644f64a464b4507d4c5a0b2c7837fd2f", "ja": "私らで、しっかりやっときますから。\nこっちのことは心配せんでええですよ！", "zh": "我们会好好做好的，你不用担心这边的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1036_p", "source_sha256": "6359eb5a35090393b37ae316b3de7b4424c7dfaae7209944b9d7676f803ca68b", "ja": "ありがとう！\n志保の行きそうな場所は……あ、そうだ！", "zh": "谢谢你们！\n志保可能去的地方……啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1037_p", "source_sha256": "1ce67cbb421a08c32044396f849862d747cfd63cb081320d81ee1aee889c4257", "ja": "あ、もしもし？　すみません、765プロの\n{$P$}と申しますが……。", "zh": "啊，你好？不好意思，我是765制作人的{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1039_033sih", "source_sha256": "56ea66b486bab42a45e333a2ad2a6f96d5edaee461b82acb317adbe6365551ce", "ja": "この公園、久しぶりに来たな……。\n前に来たのって、私が小さいころだったっけ。", "zh": "这个公园，好久没来了……\n上次来这里，是我还小的时候吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "23c423e08ed9c7927953a355cae5141fac415ed1b3d0b719cab49c2efd50ba68", "ja": "りっくんは、まだ生まれてなくて。\n私とお母さんとお父さん、3人だった……。", "zh": "小陆那时候还没出生。那时，我、妈妈和爸爸一共3个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1041_straycat", "source_sha256": "34070bcc3133f43a0990170d761eeef53fa6b6a96dc532891a79530b5f5612d2", "ja": "ニャー", "zh": "喵～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1042_033sih", "source_sha256": "412ad90316257b0007cdfef61fe1fee27d2afd15e1447501f05e65bd85951997", "ja": "あ……ふふ。あなたは、野良さんなの？　かわいい。\n黒いネコさんは、人懐こいんだよね……。", "zh": "啊……呵呵。你是流浪猫吗？好可爱。\n黑猫都很亲人呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1043_033sih", "source_sha256": "54cb3195d298d27911249826f7932a56922a887cf88e5dc51acffe3d8077ff63", "ja": "ねえ、ネコさん。私、けっこうがんばってたの。\n……本当よ。", "zh": "呐，小猫咪。我可是很努力了的。\n……真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1044_straycat", "source_sha256": "34070bcc3133f43a0990170d761eeef53fa6b6a96dc532891a79530b5f5612d2", "ja": "ニャー", "zh": "喵～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1045_033sih", "source_sha256": "b1ec83d253616dfc10d69c3a6a34a9a63edd774a6ae556faa3d3cecdd5940b90", "ja": "私ね、お父さんがいたの。……弟が生まれてすぐ、\nいなくなっちゃったんだけど。", "zh": "我呢，曾经有个爸爸。……不过弟弟出生后不久，他就不见了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1046_033sih", "source_sha256": "a1a920b735725441c22ffe0b80db5f159c6db98a40f45117e2028cba5ed5650d", "ja": "お父さんがいたころも、お母さんは働いていたけど。\n私がすごく小さかったころは、もっと家にいて……。", "zh": "爸爸还在的时候，妈妈也会工作。不过在我还很小的时候，她会更多地待在家里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1047_033sih", "source_sha256": "2b001a0be1c3cd8ddb8d1a620cb6cb145ba5a5e8e062e34318e9382ec09cfece", "ja": "でも、お父さんがいなくなってからは……お母さんとも\nいっしょにいられる時間が減っちゃって……。", "zh": "可是，自从爸爸不在了以后……和妈妈\n待在一起的时间也变少了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1049_033sih", "source_sha256": "77ae9a77dbfa7fed3d8bca055050a0f142318f31f846cc5a53ead85af39c2a12", "ja": "ネコさん。……どうして、\nお父さんはいなくなっちゃったのかな。", "zh": "猫猫。……爸爸他到底为什么\n会离开我们呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1050_033sih", "source_sha256": "7c3546f69f1f9c552f4b54fdc5765a2291b6f8b71305beabcb4dc8faec21341e", "ja": "お母さんは……私じゃ、\n頼りにはならないのかな……。", "zh": "妈妈她……觉得我，\n靠不住吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1051_p", "source_sha256": "d41b4a4279385469eff8dc5e9614135bf240dfc2756c8fa67f956f777b50b16e", "ja": "……そうか。\nそれが、志保の本音なんだな……。", "zh": "……这样啊。\n那就是志保的真心话啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1052_033sih", "source_sha256": "32c042df689ddd8e6fca069d22417a608dd8c956b8ce112d21cfb7f565d3d789", "ja": "えっ……{$P$}さん？\nどうしてここが……。", "zh": "咦……{$P$}先生？\n你怎么会知道这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1053_p", "source_sha256": "f3f73a3202f8d2b3822c7ec437559f38dffa594aacabd1fd0062f0445f3fb14c", "ja": "志保のお母さんから、\n志保が行きそうな場所を聞いたんだよ。", "zh": "我从志保的母亲那里，\n问到了志保可能会去的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1054_033sih", "source_sha256": "26d06540ef1f11b218bda0a8afa26ff67d28f7411c4ed269e08aec30891880f3", "ja": "そう、ですか。母が……。", "zh": "这样啊。妈妈她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1055_p", "source_sha256": "56ac8416d0a919f6a18e949af34ed1df9c321b56dd00a8a3f9900630c4b6e02e", "ja": "志保。これは俺が考えた事だから、志保のお母さんの\n考えとは、違うかもしれないんだけど……。", "zh": "志保。这是我的想法，可能和志保妈妈的想法不一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1056_033sih", "source_sha256": "6a9fd9909693769b8bdc02c60b9f2a3cbe16d31add600202bec0d895f25638dc", "ja": "！　……はい。", "zh": "！……是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1057_p", "source_sha256": "c0a1ed15b06e2f2d365930a7e09020a7f874c1bc24b58b29ef995dc1be40a282", "ja": "志保のお母さんは、志保のことを、\n頼りにしちゃいけないと思ってるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "志保的妈妈，可能觉得不能指望志保吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1058_033sih", "source_sha256": "ee89d1d099c045ac2e3656baf7608d7f6654bbae7a485a12920b734d9a6e8e01", "ja": "頼りにしちゃいけない？\n……そんな。どうしてですか。", "zh": "不能依赖？……怎么会。为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1059_p", "source_sha256": "0e75acdce808e832b25a5e2941430bb6b05f5edb7b496b30c1ecd9f631e004a7", "ja": "うん。……お母さんが、志保のお母さんで、\n志保が、お母さんの子どもだからかな。", "zh": "嗯……因为妈妈是志保的妈妈，而志保是妈妈的孩子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1060_p", "source_sha256": "439af69d2a5d2ca8b549cc0b9661b2dc665e6cad171aac5f45897401f942938c", "ja": "子どもは、大人……それも大好きな人に頼られると、\n無理をしてでも、頑張ってしまうものだから。", "zh": "小孩子在被大人……尤其是被最喜欢的人依靠时，\n哪怕勉强自己，也是会拼命去努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1062_p", "source_sha256": "2147e898d190a2e8c808cd81873a01c501f48e17f6c45c1dedaba380e4160ee3", "ja": "それでも、志保が家族のためを思ってしている事は、\nとてもありがたいと思ってるはずだよ。", "zh": "即便如此，他们应该也很感激志保为家人着想而做的这些事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1063_p", "source_sha256": "1b09befb3a06276d502e404d248010935acf319fd7f7a68f8910c50e2fdcb9a6", "ja": "何かあった時のための備えがある。それがどんなに\n心強いか、志保にはまだわからないかもしれないけど。", "zh": "为了应对突发情况而有所准备。那份安心感有多么强烈，志保现在可能还无法理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1064_p", "source_sha256": "27de6ff3716cdaa5f8f4fb8789120669a0a07e37033ee33afa7a913bf43f8ba2", "ja": "それに何より、志保の存在そのものが、\nお母さんにとっては支えなんだと思う。", "zh": "而且最重要的是，我觉得志保的存在本身，对她妈妈来说就是一种支撑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1065_033sih", "source_sha256": "7294c30055f1f67151109687d05502097943ee264a8988780a2d24c826152186", "ja": "私の存在……。", "zh": "我的存在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1066_p", "source_sha256": "5935cfe00d16f55214449df6d4c5ea1c9801799458ccbd371bbfd27135458a05", "ja": "気になる事があるなら、お母さんに聞いてみるといい。\n志保のお母さんなら、答えてくれるはずだよ。", "zh": "如果有什么在意的事，去问问妈妈比较好。\n志保的妈妈应该会回答你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1068_null", "source_sha256": "a8ba5f63568d1a2ab1f0cbe6fd89097aadb0c318b65cba044ff7567676625767", "ja": "その後……", "zh": "之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1069_p", "source_sha256": "faa8e67643caf4167f6d69c9cfc33ed5a04c8a6b12cc9498c09aa5fd66d82801", "ja": "ただいま……あれ。\nみんな、まだ残ってたんだな。", "zh": "我回来了……咦。\n大家居然还没走啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1070_015siz", "source_sha256": "98a69fa3331e129318f05e3f61a8f94b9ec173213f6a45df864a280bd555fe0e", "ja": "志保……！", "zh": "志保……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1071_036kan", "source_sha256": "21ea3f0f5a47612f04a09b1b178ccb0d5985faf829e503a280e6da818e89d28a", "ja": "おかえりなさい、志保ちゃん！", "zh": "欢迎回来，志保！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1072_033sih", "source_sha256": "fbff8787212e209d580a46cd29f23f2f9f944a03f20ccb4c1e111c0c8bc66e54", "ja": "た……ただいま。", "zh": "我……我回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1073_037nao", "source_sha256": "f71875f208794b5ed019d7790db6b716def1fd3867d8d7ec286e8bb6feb3fbaa", "ja": "志保おらんかったから、今日はレッスンしときました。\n私らだけで全体曲のダンス、終わってもうたわ！", "zh": "因为志保不在，今天我们就先练习啦。\n光靠我们几个，就把合唱曲的舞蹈全都练完咯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1074_033sih", "source_sha256": "77d92d7bcc585e42aeb054d9064d6cbf270e38f078a81f979661ea9fcbc664d6", "ja": "す、すみません。あの……。", "zh": "对、对不起。那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1075_p", "source_sha256": "bbb3b234e0a98b3a09d09e5f3902cb3aab8858a55dd2f336ce73e8b9a11f1593", "ja": "ミーティングは明日改めてやる事にするとして……\n志保、これは追いつくのが大変そうだな。", "zh": "既然会议决定明天再重新进行……\n志保，这看起来很难追上进度啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1076_033sih", "source_sha256": "93bede1a09470dcd26f7431c34315328d6149ab98cd13c53e957355085e4510e", "ja": "う……そ、そうですね。でも、\nレッスンにいなかった私が悪いので……。", "zh": "呜……是、是啊。不过，\n因为没参加训练，是我的错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1077_037nao", "source_sha256": "d8356c98f6f5dcea4585b84856ccfa3f9d5e59dd84de3b1c7fcd3fde9683c864", "ja": "なら志保は、明日1時間早く出てくること！\n私と風花とで合わせよ。な？", "zh": "那志保明天就提前1个小时过来！我和风花陪你一起练。好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1078_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a8767492755ef50db2baed38bdb4b3e6a9ffffa8e297b7a3120850ece5925764", "ja": "私たち、明日の予定はレッスンだけだから。\n志保ちゃんも、それでいいかな？", "zh": "我们明天的安排只有课程而已。\n志保，这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1079_033sih", "source_sha256": "488f4b011344e8647fa37aecae644b3ba806558002a3f8ae268e7bfd4036c790", "ja": "奈緒さん、風花さん……ありがとうございます。\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "奈绪小姐、风花小姐……谢谢你们。\n那就麻烦你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1080_p", "source_sha256": "f6d83edfefdfe6da87e131935ce16edf2b7685e86a6e3ba05d9391f657b8d5df", "ja": "（その後、遅くなったので志保達を家まで送った。\n志保、お母さんとちゃんと話せてるだろうか……）", "zh": "（之后，因为时间已经很晚了，我把志保她们送回了家。志保不知道有没有好好和妈妈聊过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1081_null", "source_sha256": "d61035b0ea5660e1afaeaf05982ae34c23f6ea3a694e6b7c4d54f180c13cc95c", "ja": "夜……", "zh": "夜晚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1082_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "b078bab98eca828c59111b1b363233acd844bbc0be83c200a81e30380774334e", "ja": "りっくん、やっと寝たわ。熱が下がった途端、\nお姉ちゃんお姉ちゃんってはしゃいじゃって。ふふ。", "zh": "里克终于睡着了。烧一退，就兴奋地一直喊着姐姐、姐姐。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1083_033sih", "source_sha256": "16f5e6b96c80c80d4457cd01a4e67386c91c0869d9e3c1d43e486d6b0bb1a52b", "ja": "あ……うん。……。", "zh": "啊……嗯……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1084_033sih", "source_sha256": "8db99474990e88f399fda5a1ee70764db98f875b880a9fe399da5a0d79cd46cb", "ja": "あの、お母さん。\n私、聞きたいことがあるの。", "zh": "那个，妈妈。\n我有件事想问问您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1085_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "56ff40b4de776291191efd1b3ce67e4b8c0ec9c46fd0147eae910dca852b71da", "ja": "あら、なぁに？", "zh": "哎呀，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1086_033sih", "source_sha256": "b0e0023c426c1b93480b46840bff40e935b133d92b59c391a87e902b379d61cb", "ja": "その……ど、どうしていつも、引き出しの\n封筒にお金を入れて置いてあるの？", "zh": "那个……为、为什么总是把钱放在抽屉里的信封里呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1087_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "fcf93d93ca6a211c98bbb973a2e5917c4d028a0ecf05f47c8b293bdec6fb813e", "ja": "それはもちろん、お母さんがいない間に、\n何かあった時のためによ。", "zh": "那当然是为了在妈妈不在的时候，万一出了什么事嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1088_033sih", "source_sha256": "28dea1ef295aa40e652c08d419f6f4962a8b38c8d0c8edee3129a005bc24fca2", "ja": "何かって……。", "zh": "什么叫什么啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1089_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "5eeb5c75d5b1bcc2b0966dc80a97da160bc10c01fe230d0ddee2a5e696707665", "ja": "お母さんがいない時に、昨日みたいにりっくんの\n具合が悪くなったり、志保がケガをしたり……。", "zh": "妈妈不在的时候，要是像昨天那样小陆身体不舒服，或者志保受伤了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1090_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "19c57997d54477c3b9ed97efb721c95ef63f351a0971157491d1d51f36f7db21", "ja": "逆に、お母さんに何かあったりしても……\nこうして当座のお金があれば、安心でしょう？", "zh": "反过来说，就算妈妈出了什么事……\n有了这些应急用的钱，也会安心一些吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1091_033sih", "source_sha256": "9c7e7361cbd781e06f5cd6d2d98d1fba9924115db1e0d792de87df4e0b8bd8d5", "ja": "安心……。\nだから、私のお給料も使わないの？", "zh": "安心……。\n所以，才连我的薪水也不用吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1092_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "e4df8bf232b2087515b6135825b3804e6abf2ab09574f53fe0fca7533c4fe9b9", "ja": "そうよ。志保がせっかくお給料を渡してくれても、\nお母さんが仕事を休めないのは、変わらないし……。", "zh": "是啊。就算志保好不容易把工资交给我，妈妈没法请假不上班这件事也不会改变……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1093_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "566e2ec17b898d044b625cba93f39978d3bf886e5f3a0dcdbd43dd1c05ac9785", "ja": "それにね、志保が頑張って稼いだお金だもの！\nもったいなくて、無駄遣いなんかできないわ。ふふっ。", "zh": "而且，这是志保努力赚来的钱嘛！舍不得花，才不能乱花呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1094_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "a3e32f15332c59ac1501478c2721f9e29372aa5a8af08ad6d2e97b2b14601650", "ja": "今は大丈夫だから、将来のために貯めておくの。\nきっと、とっても役に立つわ。ありがたい限りね。", "zh": "现在还没关系，所以要为将来存起来。一定会派上很大的用场。真是感激不尽呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1095_033sih", "source_sha256": "7cc7b4df6f3535648c2d49a24228c976d5c2e249d23a71c6ed472877f23fcf32", "ja": "……{$P$}さんが、\n言ったとおりだった。", "zh": "……正如{$P$}先生\n说的那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1096_shihonohaha", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_078_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_078_1097_033sih", "source_sha256": "74e21e73bdb6d726bb283e5688db4ded83e927fba98cafb132e0aef0fbdb0751", "ja": "ううん、なんでもない。……お母さん、あの。\nもうひとつ、聞いてほしいことがあるんだけど。", "zh": "不是，没什么。……妈妈，那个。\n我还有一件事想请你听我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
